Citadel (module citadel), Diaithir port to Minecraft 26.1.2 / NeoForge 26.1.2.116.
Original work: Citadel, copyright Alexthe668, https://github.com/Alexthe666/Citadel (branch 1.21, version 2.7.1), LGPL-3.0 (LICENSE, COPYING).
Included: animation, math, collision and pathing helper classes, advanced model boxes and the model animator.
